{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_83_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_83","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_83_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_83","textTraditional":"二十年春，新作南門。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_83_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_83","textTraditional":"夏，郜子來朝。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_83_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_83","textTraditional":"五月乙巳，西宮災。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_83_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_83","textTraditional":"鄭人入滑。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_83_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_83","textTraditional":"秋，齊人、狄人盟于邢。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_83_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_83","textTraditional":"冬，楚人伐隨。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_83_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_83","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_83_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_83","textTraditional":"二十年春，新作南門。書，不時也。凡啟塞，從時。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_83_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_83","textTraditional":"滑人叛鄭，而服於衛。夏，鄭公子士、洩堵寇，帥師入滑。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_83_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_83","textTraditional":"秋，齊、狄盟于邢，為邢謀衛難也。於是衛方病邢。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_83_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_83","textTraditional":"隨以漢東諸侯叛楚。冬，楚鬬穀於菟帥師伐隨，取成而還。君子曰：「隨之見伐，不量力也。量力而動，其過鮮矣。善敗由己，而由人乎哉？《詩》曰：『豈不夙夜，謂行多露。』」","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_83_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_83","textTraditional":"宋襄公欲合諸侯，臧文仲聞之，曰：「以欲從人則可，以人從欲鮮濟。」","sentenceOrder":13}],"overrides":{}}